---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Erasmus+ Grecja - ZSEiU Łaziska Górne" description="Erasmus+ Grecja „Pod stokami Olimpu” – zagraniczne praktyki zawodowe w Nei Pori dla uczniów ZSEiU.">

  <article class="w-full max-w-5xl mx-auto min-w-0">

    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-linear-to-br from-blue-900 via-indigo-950 to-slate-900 dark:from-blue-950 dark:via-indigo-900 dark:to-slate-950 border border-blue-700/50 dark:border-blue-700/50 p-5 sm:p-10 mb-10 w-full">
      <div class="cyber-grid absolute inset-0 opacity-20" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="cyber-glow absolute -top-20 -right-20 w-80 h-80 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="cyber-glow absolute -bottom-20 -left-20 w-80 h-80 bg-indigo-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10">
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-300 border border-blue-500/30 mb-4">Erasmus+ Grecja</span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-3 leading-tight wrap-break-word">&bdquo;Pod stokami <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-linear-to-r from-blue-300 via-indigo-400 to-blue-400">Olimpu&rdquo;</span></h1>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-xl text-blue-200 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed wrap-break-word">Zagraniczne praktyki zawodowe &ndash; Nei Pori, Grecja</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-8 w-full">
      <div class="rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/70 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 p-5 text-center min-w-0">
        <span class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-1">Nr projektu</span>
        <span class="block text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 break-all">2024-1-PL01-KA121-VET-000213552</span>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/70 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 p-5 text-center min-w-0">
        <span class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-1">Okres realizacji</span>
        <span class="block text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">01.06.2024 &ndash; 31.08.2025</span>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/70 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 p-5 text-center min-w-0">
        <span class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-1">Dofinansowanie</span>
        <span class="block text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">55 531,00 EUR</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="prose max-w-none dark:prose-invert mb-8">
      <p>W ramach Programu Erasmus+, Akcja KA121 w miesi&#261;cach jesiennych 2024 szko&#322;a organizowa&#322;a zagraniczne praktyki zawodowe dla uczni&#243;w ucz&#261;cych si&#281; w kierunkach: <strong>technik logistyk, technik elektryk i technik organizacji turystyki</strong>.</p>
      <p><strong>Miejsce praktyk:</strong> Grecja, miejscowo&#347;&#263; Nei Pori.</p>
      <p>Praktyki by&#322;y finansowane w ca&#322;o&#347;ci przez Uni&#281; Europejsk&#261;.</p>

      <h3>Kryteria naboru</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>oceny z przedmiot&#243;w zawodowych (&#347;wiadectwo szkolne na zako&#324;czenie roku szkolnego 2023/2024)</li>
        <li>ocena z j&#281;zyka angielskiego (&#347;wiadectwo szkolne na zako&#324;czenie roku szkolnego 2023/2024)</li>
        <li>zaanga&#380;owanie spo&#322;eczne</li>
        <li>reprezentowanie szko&#322;y</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/70 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 p-6 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Dokumenty</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li>
          <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1E7ZYBxXWesHt0VNUxj-X0I5VIxywpx8c/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 hover:underline">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><path d="M14 2v6h6"></path></svg>
            Regulamin
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.zseiulaziska.pl/zseiu2020/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/FormularzzgoszeniowyuczniaERASMUS.docx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 hover:underline">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><path d="M14 2v6h6"></path></svg>
            Formularz zg&#322;oszeniowy dla uczni&#243;w
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1eWVVlQCDN9v2EmNVdfoPXIjlhPZSJuuX/edit?usp=drive_link&ouid=111476898534157289221&rtpof=true&sd=true" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 hover:underline">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><path d="M14 2v6h6"></path></svg>
            Formularz zg&#322;oszeniowy dla nauczycieli
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/70 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 p-6 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Relacje z wyjazdu</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-3">Obserwuj nas w mediach spo&#322;eczno&#347;ciowych:</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/zseiu" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-blue-200 dark:hover:bg-blue-800/40 transition-colors">Facebook</a>
        <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@bradowicze" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800/50 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors">TikTok</a>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/brada_erasmus/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-pink-100 dark:bg-pink-900/30 text-pink-700 dark:text-pink-300 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-pink-200 dark:hover:bg-pink-800/40 transition-colors">Instagram</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/70 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 p-6 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Podsumowanie wyjazdu</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.zseiulaziska.pl/zseiu2020/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/GrecjaErasmuspodsumowanieuczniw.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 hover:underline">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><path d="M14 2v6h6"></path></svg>
            Prezentacja &ndash; podsumowanie uczni&#243;w
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.zseiulaziska.pl/zseiu2020/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/PodsumowanieprogramuErasmus.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 hover:underline">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><path d="M14 2v6h6"></path></svg>
            Podsumowanie programu Erasmus+
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </article>
</Layout>
